    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The PUC certifies that your vehicle meets environmental emission standards. A valid certificate must be issued within the last 30 days; otherwise, the transport company may refuse pickup or the vehicle may be held at customs.</p>
